    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": " ",
    "course_pol": "Grading in this course will be based on following weighted factors：\n1. Participation in class discussions, group work, and bring in positive contributions to the class (30%)\n    a. Mid-term Presentation (30%)\n    b. Final Presentation (40%)\n\n2. Presentations\n    Each study group shall prepare a 20 minutes oral presentation related to the course contents.  At the presentation day, the presenting student should submit a hardcopy to the instructor, and the grading is based on the presentation topic (20%), contents (60%), skills (10%), and question response (10%).",
    "course_pol_en": null,
    "course_rem": null,
    "course_rem_en": null,
    "ais_meno": "<div>剽竊是對學術信任的嚴重破壞。在學習作業中，我們的言論和想法就是我們作業的價值；因此將他人的作品當作自己的作品繳交，是一種盜竊行為。當您使用別人的文字和想法時，無論是著名作家還是同學的作品，而不註明這些文章、詞語和想法的來源出處，您的行為就是在抄襲，抄襲的作品將會收到&ldquo;0&rdquo;或&ldquo;不及格&rdquo;的分數。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": null,
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
